<title>MALAYSIA: Bank Negara's reserves rise to 69.09 bln rgt.</title>
<headline>Bank Negara's reserves rise to 69.09 bln rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Negara's gold, foreign exchange and other reserves increased to 69.09 billion ringgit as at November 15, 1996 compared with 68.54 billion a fortnight earlier, the Bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>The central bank said its total assets and liabilities rose to 96.34 billion ringgit from 96.28 billion two weeks earlier.  </p>
<p> (In bln rgt)   Nov 15, 1996     Oct 31,1996   Nov 15, 1995</p>
<p> Reserves	    69.09		68.54	    62.54</p>
<p> Assets		96.34		96.28	    88.40</p>
<p> Currency	    20.14		19.84	    18.00</p>
<p> Govt paper	   3.21		 3.09	     2.36</p>
<p>- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
